[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8520.07, "timestamp": "02:22:00", "text": "他们有任何瓜葛，只想做我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8522.309, "timestamp": "02:22:02", "text": "自己的事，走我自己的路。 就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8526.309, "timestamp": "02:22:06", "text": "我希望你们能继续支持我，与我一​​起走下去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8528.56, "timestamp": "02:22:08", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8530.79, "timestamp": "02:22:10", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8533.349, "timestamp": "02:22:13", "text": "我应该采取行动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8538.55, "timestamp": "02:22:18", "text": "好，看看情况如何吧。 嗯，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8542.07, "timestamp": "02:22:22", "text": "让我们看看结果如何。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8544.389, "timestamp": "02:22:24", "text": "这个月我要和我的律师开很多会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8546.95, "timestamp": "02:22:26", "text": "。 所以，这个、那个、还有那个，这个、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8550.71, "timestamp": "02:22:30", "text": "那个。 所以，看看情况如何吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8553.99, "timestamp": "02:22:33", "text": "呃，嗨，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8556.389, "timestamp": "02:22:36", "text": "同性恋。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8561.11, "timestamp": "02:22:41", "text": "，我的整个事情都……嗯……就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8565.67, "timestamp": "02:22:45", "text": "凤凰时代一样。 不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8567.91, "timestamp": "02:22:47", "text": "坐姿正确。 我此刻已化为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8572.15, "timestamp": "02:22:52", "text": "灰烬。 我正在慢慢地从灰烬中重获新生，就像重新"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8578.15, "timestamp": "02:22:58", "text": "活过来一样，你"}]